### Listar pedidos
GET http://sheapshopping.com/backend/listarpedidos
Accept: application/json

### Crear pedido completo (total/precio se calculan con el catálogo)
POST http://sheapshopping.com/backend/agregar_pedido
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_usuario": 3,
  "items": [
    {
      "id_inventario": 2,
      "cantidad": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Aprobar o rechazar pedido
PUT http://sheapshopping.com/backend/update_pedido
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_pedido": 1,
  "estado": "aprobado"
}

### Eliminar pedido y devolver el stock reservado
DELETE http://sheapshopping.com/backend/delete_pedido
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_pedido": 1
}
